{"channelId":"UCe7zjkIkTVINFeFt6ltniLg","row":["Family Support Services of North Florida",37,"Family Support Services of North Florida (FSSNF) is the lead agency for foster care, adoption and family preservation in Duval, Nassau, Pasco and Pinellas counties in Florida. Through community-based care, FSS provides services and programs to help prevent child abuse and neglect, to promote a healthy family environment and prevention services, care for our community's children in foster care, and permanency through adoption. The nonprofit organization was established in 2001 to provide child protective services in Duval County, and was expanded to also serve Nassau County in 2007. In 2022, our community of care expanded to Pasco and Pinellas counties in Florida's Suncoast. Learn more about our mission and support services at familysupport.org.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCe7zjkIkTVINFeFt6ltniLg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCe7zjkIkTVINFeFt6ltniLg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:29.125Z","channelId":"UCe7zjkIkTVINFeFt6ltniLg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"2c5063f6a2fffc0b0ea2f4ecc0aab5aed18f6caac4d12ec6717ac8dbc61aaccd","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"b9cbb414d01f3fa347b1d2a1dc2a8e169ab3b8e0d5f667dfb72dfb9b31e4ec78"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCe7zjkIkTVINFeFt6ltniLg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:29.125Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCe7zjkIkTVINFeFt6ltniLg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":37,"raw":"37 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCe7zjkIkTVINFeFt6ltniLg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:29.125Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":[